# Scene1-1-8

; ========================================
; ●シーン1‐1-8
; [back11]
; ========================================

; ========================================
; ＞『娯楽室』を選択
; ========================================

; ========================================
; [bgm Bgm_011_001_Loop]
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:11_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_11_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛她们来到了二楼的娱乐室。<br>这里应该是囚犯最常来的地方。|#0101Adv12_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:呀，这里正是适合休息的地方耶！|#0101Adv12_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:宽广的室内铺着柔软的地毯，<br>设置有舒适宜居的沙发。|#0101Adv12_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这里的设备一应俱全。有西洋棋、桌游、桌球台……<br>连大型银幕和投影机都有。|#0101Adv12_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:有人比艾玛她们先到这里。<br>是佐伯米莉亚，她正坐在沙发上。|#0101Adv12_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛和雪莉的视线自然而然<br>转向米莉亚身上。|#0101Adv12_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她正在银幕上<br>播放着8mm胶片里的黑白电影。|#0101Adv12_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……唉。|#0101Adv12_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚发出一声忧郁的叹息。她几乎没在看电影，<br>而是面露困倦地按着手机。|#0101Adv12_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚的手机上<br>也装着一个亮晶晶的豪华保护套，<br>看起来相当衬她的外表。|#0101Adv12_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:你不觉得有点安心吗？|#0101Adv12_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:欸？|#0101Adv12_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1
[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀，就是感觉，学校里面常见的女孩子就是这个样子的啦。|#0101Adv12_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:"（确实……感觉她应该属于班上最引人注目的小团体……<br>　是我从来不敢搭话的那类人……）|#0101Adv12_Ema002|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:——接着。|#0101Adv12_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Surprised1,ArmR1,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:哇啊！|#0101Adv12_Miria002| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚的肩膀忽然夸张地颤抖了一下，<br>害艾玛和雪莉也吓了一跳。|#0101Adv12_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Surprised1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:你怎么啦米莉亚！？|#0101Adv12_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，呃……叫什么来着。<br>不好意思，我还记不太清楚你们的长相和名字。对不起啦。|#0101Adv12_Miria003| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:面对刚来的艾玛和雪莉，<br>米莉亚露出了不知所措的神色。|#0101Adv12_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:我叫橘雪莉，她是樱羽艾玛。<br>我说，你刚才是被什么吓到了？|#0101Adv12_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是、是吗。我刚刚在看手机，<br>突然有个猫耳女孩子出现在屏幕上。<br>你们的手机应该也可以看到。|#0101Adv12_Miria004| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（出现在手机里……？）|#0101Adv12_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛打开了自己的手机。<br>|#0101Adv12_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:接着，她就看到囚犯名单上的“泽渡可可”那边<br>显示“正在直播”。|#0101Adv12_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyTextPrinter Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Normal.Stream MakeDefault:true HideOther:true
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:1.4 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,40 AppearanceAndTransition:1_1 SubId:Middle
@SpawnBlur ActorId:MainBackground-Middle Intensity:0.5 FadeDuration:0
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.6 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,30 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1 SubId:Middle
@Wait WaitMode:0.3

[PrintTextModified Text:点开之后，<br>可可的大脸立刻占领了整个屏幕。|#0101Adv12_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyTextPrinter Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Normal.Default MakeDefault:true HideOther:true
@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR1,ArmL7
@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1
@HideActors ActorIds:MainBackground-Middle,Coco-Middle Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.3

[PrintTextModified Text:哇啊！|#0101Adv12_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（和米莉亚做了一模一样的反应……）|#0101Adv12_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:欸～这个APP居然还可以直播耶！|#0101Adv12_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉看着自己的手机，十分感慨地说道。<br>这时，画面里神情兴奋的可可也开始发言。|#0101Adv12_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 配信フレームIN
; ＠備考◆配信中
@ResetText
@ModifyTextPrinter Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Normal.Stream MakeDefault:true HideOther:true
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:1.4 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,40 AppearanceAndTransition:1_1 SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.6 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,30 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Smile1 SubId:Middle
@Wait WaitMode:0.3

[PrintTextModified Text:大家好～我是可可碳～！<br>今天开始我会经常开直播～！记得多来看哦～！|#0101Adv12_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆配信中

[PrintTextModified Text:哦，在线观众3个！<br>看来开了个好头？请多多转发推介哦！|#0101Adv12_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可最多也只能同时在线11个人耶。|#0101Adv12_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这个是不能直说的吧……|#0101Adv12_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆配信中

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:首先是，嗯……从我的兴趣讲起吧。|#0101Adv12_Coco003| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆配信中

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:我的兴趣就是推活哦。|#0101Adv12_Coco004| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆配信中

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Smile1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:推活正是我的人生！除了我推都没有活着的价值！<br>其他人全都给我去死！就这样子——|#0101Adv12_Coco005| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyTextPrinter Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Normal.Default MakeDefault:true HideOther:true
@HideActors ActorIds:Sherry,Ema,Miria Duration:0 Lazy:false
@HideActors ActorIds:MainBackground-Middle,Coco-Middle Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.3

[PrintTextModified Text:在场所有人几乎同时<br>关闭了直播。|#0101Adv12_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:根本浪费时间呢。|#0101Adv12_Sherry008| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:这个是不能直说的吧……|#0101Adv12_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:现场所有人达成了共识：<br>泽渡可可毫无作为直播主的吸引力。|#0101Adv12_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:究竟为什么会有直播的功能呢。|#0101Adv12_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:算是某种程度的安慰剂吧？<br>毕竟是我们日常生活会见到的东西。|#0101Adv12_Sherry009| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那可不可以当联络外部的手段……|#0101Adv12_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不行吧，<br>幕后黑手不至于这么笨。|#0101Adv12_Sherry010| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:说得也对……|#0101Adv12_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛和雪莉重整旗鼓，<br>开始探索娱乐室。|#0101Adv12_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛往收纳柜里瞧了瞧，<br>里面放满了老旧的胶片。|#0101Adv12_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（米莉亚竟然懂得怎么播放<br>　这么老的电影……）|#0101Adv12_Ema011|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:坐在沙发上的米莉亚，<br>精神散漫地看着黑白电影，一动也不动。|#0101Adv12_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR6,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:唉……|#0101Adv12_Miria005| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（感觉……她是不是有些心病……？）|#0101Adv12_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛和雪莉再也没找到值得关注的事物，<br>于是便离开了娱乐室。|#0101Adv12_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

